    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nUpdates the Processor Certification Requirements Document (CRD) output to remove most appendices (keeping only CSR details) and to reduce/trim generated content per the CSC agreement in #1437.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Removed CRD appendices for extensions, instructions, and IDL functions (CSR appendix remains).\n- Simplified CRD tables (column sizing) and removed UDB cross-linking for extension/instruction summary entries.\n- Trimmed CSR appendix content (commented out descriptions, removed SW read/write sections) and updated privilege-mode rendering.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 3 out of 3 changed files in this pull request and generated 4 comments.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| backends/proc_crd/templates/proc_crd.adoc.erb | Trims CRD content, adjusts table formatting, removes most appendices while keeping CSR appendix. |\n| backends/proc_cert/templates/priv_modes.adoc.erb | Suppresses the “Privileged Modes” section when the certificate scope is U-only. |\n| backends/portfolio/templates/csr_appendix.adoc.erb | Trims CSR appendix content, adjusts table formatting, and changes how CSR privilege mode and related content are rendered. |\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
